RULE: AUTO-UPDATE DOCS
1. Whenever you create, edit, or delete any code file, you MUST update the relevant file in /docs/.
2. Never ask to read whole project again. Read only /docs/LLM_CONTEXT.md for context.
3. If you add a new API, update /docs/API_DOCS.md and /docs/LLM_CONTEXT.md
4. If you add a new component, update /docs/COMPONENTS.md and FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md
5. If you change DB model, update DATABASE.md
6. Always update CHANGELOG.md with date and change.
7. Follow RULES.md strictly. Don't break existing patterns.
